	(text "Pull-up on the WIRE side of the 10k; clamp and 100n on the GPIO side.\nA pull-up on the GPIO side leaves a closed switch at ~2.2 V, which does not read LOW.\n10k x 100n = ~1 ms filter (ELE-04). BAT54S makes a mis-wired PNP sensor survivable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
